OL,3,ATrump says he 'convinced' Nvidia to
OL,4,Areinstate Jensen Huang
OL,5,
OL,6,FPresident Donald Trump said he spoke to
OL,7,FNvidia's board of directors and
OL,8,F"convinced" them to reinstate Jensen
OL,9,FHuang as CEO.
OL,11,FIn a brief interview with CNBC, Trump
OL,12,Fsaid that he gave the board
OL,13,F"assurances" that Huang's extramarital
OL,14,Faffair did not present a national
OL,15,Fsecurity issue for the US.
OL,17,FHuang resigned from Nvidia on 12
OL,18,FNovember following reports of a series
OL,19,Fof extramarital affairs, including one
OL,20,Fwith a woman alleged to have ties to
OL,21,FChinese intelligence.
OL,23,APub: 23-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
