OL,3,ATrump says he 'convinced' Nvidia to
OL,4,Areinstate Jensen Huang
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe US president, however, has
OL,7,Frepeatedly expressed support for the
OL,8,Fembattled CEO despite the vocal
OL,9,Fopposition of lawmakers - including
OL,10,Fsome Republicans - to his being
OL,11,Freinstated at the company.
